      "side": 1,
      "message": "While the comments above seem to disagree, and I think the logic will work as long as nobody changes the vbus_source_enable function or manually sets this bit, I think this isn\u0027t the bit we need to check. This just says the direction of the HV path, but it could always be 0 even when we\u0027re sourcing. This doesn\u0027t enable the sink path or choose the path we are using. \n\nI think we need to check the power_enb and ch_sel bits.",
